  "extra_vbs": "Sub PadResetDrops(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tDTRaise 1\n\t\tDTRaise 2\n\t\tDTRaise 3\n\t\tDropCount = 0\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadPostRight(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tpost001_IsDropped 0\n\tElse\n\t\tpost001_IsDropped 1\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadPostLeft(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tpost002_IsDropped 0\n\tElse\n\t\tpost002_IsDropped 1\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadRampUp(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tRampUp\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadRampDown(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tRampDown\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadTopEject(e)   ' the table's own Exit_Underworld: ramp up, kick, ramp down 800 ms later\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tRampUp\n\t\tbsUnderworld.SolOut True\n\t\tvpmTimer.AddTimer 800, \"RampDown '\"\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n",
